footer  (s2, after the edit) [green] Update SolidWorks will move FIdler along Idler and FOut along Front, and re-place Carrier (the carrier), Sun, Pl (3 copies), InDog, LoDog, RangeSlv, FrontDog, ModeSlv, FDrive, FIdler and FOut. It was built with a configuration per mode (2H, 4H, N and 4L), each named as its mode, and saved in 2H; to switch mode, double-click another mode's configuration in SolidWorks' ConfigurationManager. Drag Sun in SolidWorks to turn one train and FrontDog to turn the other. A turn you give the gears in one mode can show in other modes, so a dog can stand across its sleeve in another; to put the gears back there, press Update SolidWorks with that mode showing. Carrier (the carrier) is axes and planes only, so it has nothing to drag. TransferCase_E4 has changes from Update SolidWorks that are not saved: save it in SolidWorks to keep it. If SolidWorks closed it without saving, press Update SolidWorks to make them again.
